  "summary": "Implement real discrepancy detection and summary rendering so the tests pass. The matcher now returns the expected four discrepancy kinds (amount_mismatch, duplicate_left, missing_left, missing_right) and the report renders counts for missing_left and missing_right.",
  "files": [
